// @name: Arabic — maqam Rast
// @tagline: quarter-tone melody
// @description: A maqam Rast line in just intonation — neutral 3rd (sikah) and 7th (awj).
// @language: bpscript
// @outputs: audio
// @level: intermediate
// @tags: microtonal, melody
// @showcase
//
// Maqam Rast — Arabic quarter-tone scale
// Noms de degrés arabes (perde) : rast dukah sikah jaharkah nawa husayni awj,
// avec les intervalles en quarts de ton de l'accordage arabic_24TET.

@core
@alphabet.arabic:audio
@tuning.arabic_24TET
@tempo:70

-----
S -> Sayr Rujoo Qarar

Sayr -> rast dukah sikah jaharkah nawa husayni awj (wave:sine, vel:85)
Rujoo -> awj husayni nawa jaharkah sikah dukah rast (vel:70)
Qarar -> rast _ _ _ _ (vel:60)
